# Format:
# Number|ScriptName|FileName

# Example:
# 0|Exit|Exit
# 1|CleanTemp|CleanTemp

# Note:
# Files of the scripts included in "DUU-Launcher_Info.conf" have to be in OS directory.
# Exit option name should be either "Exit" or "exit" to make it work without changing code.
# File name should not include file format.


# To make it work you need:
# 1. Create or rename this file with the name "DUU-Launcher_Info.conf" in "Configs" directory.
# 2. Add there options following the format and example written up there.
# 3. Run "DUU-Launcher_{OS}".
# Or download "DUU-Launcher_Info.conf" from the GitHub repository "https://github.com/RuslOFFICIAL/Daily-Use-Utilities.git".
